+	  Say Y or M here if you want to enable support for the Samsung
+	  SOFEF03F M FHD command mode AMOLED panel with DSC, found in
+	  the OnePlus 7T (hotdogb).  The panel is 1080x2400 at 60Hz and
+	  uses 4 DSI lanes with 8 bits per component.
+
 config DRM_PANEL_SEIKO_43WVF1G
 	tristate "Seiko 43WVF1G panel"
 	depends on OF
